% The row in force on the calculation date, of the table's dated versions below.
the snap net income limit 100 percent fpl 48 states dc table for a household size is an amount if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and the snap net income limit 100 percent fpl 48 states dc table for the household size from a date N to a date M is the amount
    and N <= D
    and D <= M.

the snap net income limit 100 percent fpl 48 states dc table for 1 from 2025-10-01 to 9999-12-31 is 1305, as stated in "USDA SNAP FY 2026 income eligibility standards".

